flowchart LR
    Source[KB source] --> Document[Document]
    Document --> Job[Reindex job]
    Job --> Claim[Worker claims job]
    Claim --> Chunk[Split into chunks]
    Chunk --> Embed[Batch embeddings]
    Embed --> Store[Persist chunks]
    Store --> Ask[User question]
    Ask --> Filter[Tenant + role filters]
    Filter --> Retrieve[Full-text + semantic search]
    Retrieve --> Fuse[Rank fusion]
    Fuse --> Answer[Cited answer]
    Answer --> Log[Query log]
    Log --> Review[Content review backlog]
    Review --> Source
